OL,3,GNEWSAAirport baggage systems hit by
OL,4,Apower outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Airport has said a number
OL,7,Fof its systems have been affected by a
OL,8,Fpower cut.
OL,10,FThe airport in Castle Donington,
OL,11,FLeicestershire, said its baggage
OL,12,Fservice remains out of action after a
OL,13,F"brief" power cut on Monday.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the airport said
OL,16,Fengineers were continuing to work to
OL,17,Ffix the issue.
OL,19,FPassengers have been advised to go to
OL,20,Fthe airport as usual, but to check with
OL,21,Ftheir airlines for the latest flight
OL,22,Finformation.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
